            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) is still regarded as an enormous medical challenge due to its complexity and poor prognosis. In spite of progress in research and therapy lethality remains unacceptably high. Besides established interventiotnal treatment options, numerous pharmacological approaches have been investigated in the past decades.</AbstractText>
